MERGE (pr:Protein {name: 'phosphodiesterase'}) WITH pr MATCH (p:Paper {number: '035'}) MERGE (p)-[:MENTIONS_PROTEIN {context: 'Involved in the degradation of cyclic AMP and has different specificity compared to the CAMP receptor.'}]->(pr);
